      "stem_html": "<p>Tranexamsýra, lyf sem er gagnlegt gegn blóðtappa, er framleitt í iðnaði úr <i>p</i>-metýlbensonítríli. Settu fram skrefin sem líkleg eru til að vera notuð í mynduninni. (Hafðu ekki áhyggjur af cis-trans hverfum; hitun í 300 °C umbreytir hverfunum.)</p>\n<img class=\"scaled-down\" src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBazRYIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--10eda77abc2d52e948b3f1637e51635a9f702ad9/OChem_21_EC_055.jpg\" alt=\"The structure of tranexamic acid comprises of a cyclohexane ring wedge-bonded to a carboxylic acid group and dash-bonded to hydrogen at C 1, and wedge-bonded to hydrogen and dash-bonded to methylamine at C 4.\">",
